{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-switch-phone-components-2-a-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-1","surface":"phone","area":"phone/components-2","refs":["F-phone-1414","F-phone-1420"],"severity":"S4","title":"Restoring a backup can turn 'Reminders from my gym' off while the gym's reminders stay set on the phone","what":"A backup file carries the member's 'Reminders from my gym' switch. A restore puts the switch back and at once re-sets the workout reminders and the trainer-share switch, but not the gym's reminders. So if the backup had the switch off, plan-ending and birthday reminders already set on the phone still arrive until the app next reaches the gym (at start or the hourly check, and only when online). The other way round, a switch put back on starts nothing until then.","expected":"A restore that changes 'Reminders from my gym' sets or cancels the gym's reminders at once, the same way it already does for the workout reminders.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/backup/backupFormat.ts:140","apps/mobile/src/backup/backupSettings.ts:112-124","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymReminders.ts:257-259","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymActions.ts:255-268","apps/mobile/src/components/settings/GymSettings.tsx:146-158"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"restore-skips-gym-reminder-resync","who":"members of a gym who restore a backup","how_often":"rarely: only when the restored switch differs from the phone's","fix_line":"After a restore, re-set the gym's reminders from the switch, as is already done for workout reminders","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
